I ran steps 1–9 of `収集手順.md` for the 6:00 run on 2026-11-24 and added **16 catches** (Tokyo Bay 7, Sagami Bay 8, Suruga Bay 1). All of them are from 11/23. No 11/24 catches have been posted yet, and many boats posted that they cancelled today's trips because of rough seas.

